    <title>CS61B--Day03</title>
    <url>/2025/11/03/CS61B-Day03/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<figure class="highlight java"><table><tbody><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">@Test</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">testMethod</span><span class="params">()</span> {</span><br><span class="line">    assertEquals(&lt;expected&gt;, &lt;actual&gt;);</span><br><span class="line">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>

<blockquote>
<p><code>assertEquals</code>&nbsp;是 JUnit 测试中常用的一个方法。它用于测试变量的实际值是否与其预期值相等。</p>
<p>当你创建 JUnit 测试文件时，你应该在每个测试方法前面都加上一个 <code>@Test</code> 注解，并且（在方法内部）可以有一个或多个 <code>assertEquals</code> 或 <code>assertTrue</code> 方法（这些方法由 JUnit 库提供）。</p>
<p><strong>所有的测试（方法）都必须是非静态的 (non-static)</strong>。</p>
<p>这可能看起来有点奇怪，因为你的测试（方法）并不使用实例变量，而且你很可能也不会去实例化这个（测试）类。然而，JUnit 的设计者就是这样决定测试应该如何编写的，所以我们就照做好了。</p>
</blockquote>
<h1 id="SLList"><a href="#SLList" class="headerlink" title="SLList"></a>SLList</h1><figure class="highlight java"><table><tbody><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> calss IntList{</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> first;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> rest;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">Intlist</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> f, <span class="type">int</span> r)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        first = f;</span><br><span class="line">        rest = r;</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br><span class="line">    ...</span><br><span class="line">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>

<blockquote>
<p>像<code>IntList</code>这样的递归数据结构是裸露的，在java中这是不太合适的</p>
</blockquote>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tbody><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> calss IntNode{</span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> item;</span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> next;</span><br><span class="line">   <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">IntNode</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> i, <span class="type">int</span> n)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">     item = i;</span><br><span class="line">     next = n;</span><br><span class="line">   }</span><br><span class="line">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<figure class="highlight java"><table><tbody><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">SLlist</span>{</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> IntNode first;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="type">int</span> size;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">SLlist</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        size = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        first = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">IntNode</span>(x, <span class="literal">null</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">/* 在列表前添加元素 */</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">addFirst</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        size += <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        first = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">IntNode</span>(x, first);</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">/* 查找第一个元素 */</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">getFirst</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> first.item;</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">/* 在链表最后添加元素 */</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">addLast</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">IntNode</span> <span class="variable">p</span> <span class="operator">=</span> first;</span><br><span class="line">        size += <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">while</span> (p.next != <span class="literal">null</span>){</span><br><span class="line">            p = p.next;</span><br><span class="line">        }</span><br><span class="line">        p.next = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">IntNode</span>(x,<span class="literal">null</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>

<blockquote>
<p>像<code>SLList</code>这样被封装后的数据结构更易于使用</p>
<p><code>private</code>关键字与<code>public</code>不同，他的可以避免被除了<code>SLLits</code>类以外的类使用</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;也就是对类的用户隐藏实现细节</p>
</blockquote>
<ul>
<li><p>如果你在java中公开了一些东西，一般来说你应该永远不要删除他</p>
</li>
<li><p>私有的东西你可以更改，用户永远不需要知道，但公共的东西应该永远有效</p>
<h1 id="哨兵节点："><a href="#哨兵节点：" class="headerlink" title="哨兵节点："></a>哨兵节点：</h1><figure class="highlight java"><table><tbody><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">SLlist</span>{</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> IntNode sentinel;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="type">int</span> size;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">SLList</span> <span class="params">()</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        sentinel = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">IntNode</span>(<span class="number">63</span>, <span class="literal">null</span>); <span class="comment">// 这里的63可以是任何数，也可以是-5或72，这无所谓</span></span><br><span class="line">        size = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">SLlist</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x)</span>{</span><br><span class="line">        size = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        sentinel = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">IntNode</span>(<span class="number">63</span>, <span class="literal">null</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        sentinel.next = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">IntNode</span>(x, <span class="literal">null</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    }</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></li>
</ul>
